### Table Definitions Created

1. **`profiles`**: Primary user identity table (`id`, `user_id`, `name`, `email`, `phone`, `role`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`). Supports roles: `ADMIN`, `DISPATCHER`, `DRIVER`, `CUSTOMER`.
2. **`drivers`**: Telematics and driver roster (`id`, `profile_id`, `employee_id`, `phone`, `vehicle_number`, `vehicle_type`, `status`, `current_latitude`, `current_longitude`, `last_location_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`).
3. **`customers`**: Corporate shipper directory (`id`, `name`, `company_name`, `email`, `phone`, `address`, `postal_code`, `created_at`, `updated_at`).
4. **`shipments`**: Consignment ledger (`id`, `tracking_number`, `customer_id`, `driver_id`, `pickup_address`, `pickup_postal_code`, `delivery_address`, `delivery_postal_code`, `package_description`, `weight`, `dimensions`, `scheduled_date`, `time_slot`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`).
5. **`trip_status_history`**: Audit trail log (`id`, `shipment_id`, `driver_id`, `status`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `notes`, `created_at`). Auto-populated via database trigger on status change.
6. **`driver_locations`**: Live GPS coordinate telemetry log (`id`, `driver_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `accuracy`, `recorded_at`). Trigger auto-updates current location on driver record.
7. **`proof_of_delivery`**: Digital POD certificates (`id`, `shipment_id`, `driver_id`, `receiver_name`, `signature_url`, `photo_url`, `notes`, `delivered_at`, `created_at`).
8. **`notifications`**: Real-time cross-app notifications (`id`, `user_id`, `title`, `message`, `type`, `read`, `created_at`).

### Row Level Security (RLS) Policies
* **`ADMIN` / `DISPATCHER`**: Full READ/WRITE permissions across all tables.
* **`DRIVER`**: Access to assigned shipments, insert to `driver_locations`, insert to `trip_status_history`, insert/update `proof_of_delivery`, and update own status.
* **`CUSTOMER`**: Access to own shipment records.

