## 4. Standardized Shipment Status System

Both Admin Website and Driver Mobile App utilize the identical status lifecycle enum:

| Status Code | Description | Next Allowed State |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `ASSIGNED` | Admin/Dispatcher assigns shipment to driver | `ACCEPTED` |
| `ACCEPTED` | Driver accepts consignment on Driver App | `GOING_TO_PICKUP` |
| `GOING_TO_PICKUP` | Driver starts driving towards pickup loading dock | `ARRIVED_AT_PICKUP` |
| `ARRIVED_AT_PICKUP` | Driver arrives at origin terminal | `PICKUP_COMPLETED` |
| `PICKUP_COMPLETED` | Cargo loaded & verified by driver | `IN_TRANSIT` |
| `IN_TRANSIT` | Highway linehaul transit in progress | `ARRIVED_AT_DELIVERY` |
| `ARRIVED_AT_DELIVERY` | Driver arrives at destination dock | `DELIVERY_COMPLETED` |
| `DELIVERY_COMPLETED` | Recipient signs POD, OTP verified, shipment delivered | Terminal State |
| `CANCELLED` | Shipment cancelled by Admin/Dispatcher | Terminal State |

